      "claim": "The required Markdown text alternatives do not preserve learner-facing structure. In all nine artifact.md files, recap list items, cheat-sheet table cells, source links and adjacent sentences are collapsed into uninterrupted strings (for example, \"history.git\", \"git statuswhich\" and \"gitignorename\" here). The same content is then duplicated under Recap, Cheat sheet and Sources, making the alternative substantially harder to scan and understand than the HTML.",
