          "section": "Intent",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-10-12T22:47:29Z",
          "textSha256": "a7f6801687d869aa95edb1995de85b781187f76520a4f833d1eb294ae8ca5c57"
        }
      ],
      "recommendation": "Fix the deterministic HTML-to-Markdown derivation to preserve paragraph, list-item, table-cell and link boundaries, remove duplicated nested recap/source content, then regenerate and review all nine artifact.md companions.",
