        "line": 245
      },
      "claim": "The review page promises broad retrieval (\"Choose the right Git command for a described situation\") and says it integrates the module, but its graded/application path checks only shell location; its terminal rehearses cd, branch, add, commit and push, while undo, stash, fetch/pull, conflicts, merge/rebase and pull-request decisions appear only in the recap. The broad objective and cumulative-review claim are therefore not aligned to observable checks.",
